                total = 0
                # Try adding 0
                if z > 0:
                    if last == 0:
                        if run + 1 <= limit:
                            total += dp(z - 1, o, 0, run + 1)
                    else:
                        total += dp(z - 1, o, 0, 1)
                # Try adding 1
                if o > 0:
                    if last == 1:
                        if run + 1 <= limit:
                            total += dp(z, o - 1, 1, run + 1)
                    else:
                        total += dp(z, o - 1, 1, 1)
                return total % MOD

            res = 0
            if zero > 0:
                res += dp(zero - 1, one, 0, 1)
            if one > 0:
                res += dp(zero, one - 1, 1, 1)
            return res % MOD
    ```

